   "demo": {
    "id": "arch-3d",
    "summary": "OpenGL running on Arch Linux's sway desktop: the guest's Mesa draws through virgl onto your browser's WebGL2. Its network reaches only Alpine's package mirror (dl-cdn.alpinelinux.org) for now.",
